ci: remove obsolete public CI bridge (#7)

The generated canonical `ci.yml` now handles untrusted pull requests
through the trust-aware lane contract. This removes the obsolete
duplicate CI graph. In Jackin, it also removes the read-only
cache-cleanup workflow that never deleted caches; the privileged manual
cleanup remains.

